  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_Shop?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5b/Gift_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713204537\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Building</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>rep</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"rep\"><img alt=\"rep\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1c/Reputation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141647\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Rep. lvl(s) 11</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 67,000</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>gift shop</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">service building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reputation</a> level 11 in the player's <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The appearance of the gift shop changes as the player upgrades it:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGift_Shop_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Gift Shop Stage 1.png (768 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/21/Gift_Shop_Stage_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713205045\" title=\"Gift Shop Stage 1.png (768 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop Stage 1.png (768 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGift_Shop_Inside_1.png\" title=\"Gift Shop Inside 1.png (736 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ac/Gift_Shop_Inside_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713205046\" title=\"Gift Shop Inside 1.png (736 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop Inside 1.png (736 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGift_Shop_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Gift Shop Stage 2.png (811 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/de/Gift_Shop_Stage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713205046\" title=\"Gift Shop Stage 2.png (811 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop Stage 2.png (811 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGift_Shop_Inside_2.png\" title=\"Gift Shop Inside 2.png (769 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ac/Gift_Shop_Inside_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713205046\" title=\"Gift Shop Inside 2.png (769 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop Inside 2.png (769 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGift_Shop.png\" title=\"Gift Shop.png (859 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5b/Gift_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713204537\" title=\"Gift Shop.png (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop.png (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGift_Shop_Inside.png\" title=\"Gift Shop Inside.png (787 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5f/Gift_Shop_Inside.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713204526\" title=\"Gift Shop Inside.png (787 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop Inside.png (787 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>The gift shop costs 67,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 1 day and 15 hours (or 91 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to build. It gives 30 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Serving</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>When the gift shop is at level 1, it takes 1 hour and 40 minutes (or 5 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to serve a customer and 6 <span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> are awarded.</li>\n<li>Serving time can be reduced to 1 hour at most.</li>\n<li>Points can be increased to a maximum of 10 <span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> per customer.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The following materials are required to upgrade the gift shop:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3AHammer.png\" title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/81/Hammer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131656\" title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Hammer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Hammer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hammer</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AStone_Block.png\" title=\"Stone Block.png (48 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/37/Stone_Block.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131613\" title=\"Stone Block.png (48 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stone block\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Stone Block.png (48 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Stone block\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/stone-block-13229\" title=\"Stone Block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Stone block</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATar_Bucket.png\" title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Tar_Bucket.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131606\" title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Tar bucket\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Tar bucket\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/tar-bucket-13237\" title=\"Tar Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tar bucket</a></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Orders</b></span></h3>\n<p>Customers visiting the gift shop usually require:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/cotton-14254\" title=\"Cotton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cotton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/wool-2270\" title=\"Wool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wool</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/beeswax-16468\" title=\"Beeswax\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Beeswax</a></li>\n<li>And products from the:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/candle-maker-16469\" title=\"Candle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candle Maker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/flower-shop-28398\" title=\"Flower Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flower Shop</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/jeweler-3562\" title=\"Jeweler\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jeweler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/hat-maker-18338\" title=\"Hat Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hat Maker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/loom-3555\" title=\"Loom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Loom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/sewing-machine-14242\" title=\"Sewing Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sewing Machine</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hammers</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/beach-caf%C3%A9-13311\" title=\"Beach Café\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Beach Café</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/cinema-13193\" title=\"Cinema\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cinema</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/town-hall-13238\" title=\"Town Hall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town Hall</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/stone-block-13229\" title=\"Stone Block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Stone blocks</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/grocery-store-13191\" title=\"Grocery Store\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Grocery Store</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spa</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/town-hall-13238\" title=\"Town Hall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town Hall</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/tar-bucket-13237\" title=\"Tar Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tar buckets</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/beach-caf%C3%A9-13311\" title=\"Beach Café\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Beach Café</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spa</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/train-station-13239\" title=\"Train Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Train Station</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/beach-caf%C3%A9-13311\" title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bf/Beach_Caf%C3%A9.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113615\" title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/bed-and-breakfast-13194\" title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Bed_and_Breakfast.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113856\" title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cinema-13193\" title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/39/Cinema.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113957\" title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/diner-13192\" title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/19/Diner.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219114114\" title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5b/Gift_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713204537\" title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrappe